#: ../../user/schema.md:173
msgid ""
"`rescript-struct` is **not** supported. The upstream package was "
"deprecated in favor of `rescript-schema` (confirmed 2026-05-09 — recorded"
" in [RFC-0002 §2.1](https://github.com/Nagatatz/rescript-"
"tauri/blob/main/docs/ideas/RFC-0002-schema-integration.md))."
